  description: '2 "Fire Fist" monsters

    While this card points to a "Fire Fist"
    monster, your opponent''s monsters cannot target this card for attacks. When
    this card declares an attack: You can send 1 face-up "Fire Formation" Spell/Trap
    you control to the GY, then target 1 monster your opponent controls; place that
    opponent''s monster in a zone this card points to and take control of it until
    the End Phase, but it cannot declare an attack this turn. You can only use this
    effect of "Brotherhood of the Fire Fist - Peacock" once per turn.'
